{"contactDetails":{"phone":"0203 9098001","hotelNationalPhone":"0333 321 3104","email":""},"hotelDescription":"\u003cp\u003eThere’s loads more to Kings Cross than trains and platforms. With 150 years of industrial heritage, it’s now an energetic new city quarter bursting with cool creative spaces, gig venues and secret bars, making it a favourite for work and play.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCatch up with friends online or watch the latest blockbuster movies through your smart TV. Customise the lighting and the temperature with our app. Stay connected with super-fast, free Wi-Fi*, and experience the city at your fingertips.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThere’s a choice of two room types at this hub hotel – Standard and Bigger.\u003c/p\u003e\n","hotelSPFDescription":"","hotelDirections":"\u003cp\u003eWhen leaving Kings Cross St Pancras Station, turn left onto York Way. Continue to follow York Way. The hotel will be on your right. The closest tube station is Kings Cross St Pancras.\u003c/p\u003e\n","location":{"country":"england","county":"greater-london","town":"london"},"acceptedCreditCards":[{"code":"AC","feeAmount":"1.00","feeCurrency":"£","paymentOnly":false,"listOrder":"3","name":"Mastercard Credit","schemeLogo":"/content/dam/global/booking/Mastercard.jpg"},{"code":"AM","feeAmount":"1.00","feeCurrency":"£","paymentOnly":false,"listOrder":"6","name":"American Express","schemeLogo":"/content/dam/global/booking/AX.jpg"},{"code":"AT","feeAmount":"","feeCurrency":"","paymentOnly":false,"listOrder":"1","name":"Business Account","schemeLogo":"/content/dam/global/booking/Business_Account.jpg"},{"code":"DL","feeAmount":"","feeCurrency":"","paymentOnly":false,"listOrder":"5","name":"Visa Debit","schemeLogo":"/content/dam/global/booking/Visa_Debit.jpg"},{"code":"EL","feeAmount":"","feeCurrency":"","paymentOnly":false,"listOrder":"9","name":"Electron","schemeLogo":"/content/dam/global/booking/Electron_white_v.jpg"},{"code":"MA","feeAmount":"","feeCurrency":"","paymentOnly":true,"listOrder":"4","name":"Maestro","schemeLogo":"/content/dam/global/booking/maestro.jpg"},{"code":"MD","feeAmount":"","feeCurrency":"","paymentOnly":false,"listOrder":"11","name":"Mastercard Debit","schemeLogo":"/content/dam/global/booking/MD.jpg"},{"code":"VI","feeAmount":"1.00","feeCurrency":"£","paymentOnly":false,"listOrder":"2","name":"Visa Credit","schemeLogo":"/content/dam/global/booking/VC.jpg"}],"parkingDescription":"","restaurant":{"brand":"HLE21","name":"Lounge","image":"/content/dam/global/restaurants/HDE/lounge logo.jpg","description":"Start your day with breakfast including fresh toast, pastries, fruit, yoghurt and porridge, plus unlimited tea, coffee and orange juice. Just ask to add breakfast to your stay at reception. Later, tuck into our tasty deli boards or range of sandwiches, soups, salads and home comfort dishes. In the evening, join us for a tipple or two during our cocktail Happy Hour. From 5pm-8pm, buy any drink from our menu and enjoy a complimentary cheese plate on us.*  \n","menus":[{"name":"Breakfast","path":"/content/dam/global/restaurants/HDE/Lounge-hot-breakfast.pdf","pathLabel":"Breakfast Menu","image":"/content/dam/pi/websites/desktop/new-hotel-details-content/restaurants/Lounge/Lounge-Breakfast-WestministerAbbey.jpg","description":"\u003cp\u003eStart your day right with a mix of continental\u003cbr\u003e\nbreakfast items and a selection of hot cooked food. From sausage, scrambled egg and bacon to fresh pastries, toast, fruit salad, yoghurts and porridge, just tuck in. Plus there’s unlimited coffee, Twinings tea and orange juice, too.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n","disclaimer":"Due to government advice regarding Covid-19, we have taken the decision to close this restaurant until further notice"},{"name":"Main menu","path":"/content/dam/global/restaurants/HDE/Lounge-standard-main.pdf","pathLabel":"Main menu","image":"/content/dam/pi/websites/desktop/new-hotel-details-content/restaurants/Lounge/Lounge-Breakfast-WestministerAbbey.jpg","description":"\u003cp\u003eTuck into our tasty deli boards or range of\u003cbr\u003e\nsandwiches, soups, salads and home comfort dishes. In the evening, join us for\u003cbr\u003e\na tipple or two during our cocktail Happy Hour*.\u003cbr\u003e\n\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr\u003e\n*Offer is 2 for 1 on all cocktails from the bar. Both cocktails must be the same and purchased at the same time. Valid when promotion is on display. Alcohol served to over 18’s only.\u003c/p\u003e\n","disclaimer":"Due to government advice regarding Covid-19, we have taken the decision to close this restaurant until further notice"}]},"hotelGooglePlus":"https://www.google.com/maps?cid\u003d7686914900010717436","parkName":"","img":"","leftList":[],"rightList":[],"distanceOverride":"","usingNewBookingFlow":true,"code":"LONKIN","name":"hub London Kings Cross","headline":"Next to King\u0027s Cross and St Pancras International stations and scenic Regent\u0027s Canal","brand":"HUB","threeWords":{"threeWords":"///sorry.venues.eaten","locationLink":"https://what3words.com/sorry.venues.eaten"},"address":{"addressline1":"50 Wharfdale Road","addressline2":"Kings Cross","addressline3":"London","country":"United Kingdom (the)","postcode":"N1 9FA"},"map":{"latitude":51.533674,"longitude":-0.122153},"images":[{"fileReference":"/content/dam/hub/hotelimages/LONKIN/Kings-Cross-1.jpg","tags":[],"renditions":["/content/dam/hub/hotelimages/LONKIN/Kings-Cross-1.jpg","/content/dam/hub/hotelimages/LONKIN/Kings-Cross-1.jpg.transform/XL/img.jpg","/content/dam/hub/hotelimages/LONKIN/Kings-Cross-1.jpg.transform/L/img.jpg","/content/dam/hub/hotelimages/LONKIN/Kings-Cross-1.jpg.transform/M/img.jpg","/content/dam/hub/hotelimages/LONKIN/Kings-Cross-1.jpg.transform/S/img.jpg"]},{"fileReference":"/content/dam/hub/hotelimages/LONKIN/Kings-Cross-2.jpg","tags":[],"renditions":["/content/dam/hub/hotelimages/LONKIN/Kings-Cross-2.jpg","/content/dam/hub/hotelimages/LONKIN/Kings-Cross-2.jpg.transform/XL/img.jpg","/con